        <mxCell id="FElhDRLnfEaFjVS6Fh-T-189" value="initialize intra communication topic subscriptions and publishers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#647687;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#314354;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-730" y="1030" width="340" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FElhDRLnfEaFjVS6Fh-T-190" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Publishers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;mode_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/mode&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonMode) - Publishes the current active mode of the hybrid automaton.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;status_publisher:&lt;/b&gt;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/status&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonStatus) - Publishes the current operational status and state information of the hybrid automaton.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;guard_evaluation_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/guard_evaluation&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonGuardEvaluation) - Publishes guard evaluation results with associated metadata for transition monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;dynamics_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/dynamics&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonDynamics) - Publishes the continuous dynamics computation results for the current active mode.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;invariant_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/invariant&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonInvariant) - Publishes invariant validation results and constraint satisfaction data for the current mode.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-310" y="780" width="1030" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FElhDRLnfEaFjVS6Fh-T-191" value="&lt;div align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Subscriptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;mode_subscription&lt;/b&gt;: Sublisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/mode&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonMode, callback: on_mode_callback) - receives the current hybrid automaton, on receive performs the on mode callback function, this function validates the mode received and generates a mode profile, meaning extracts transition functions and guards and such utilization by other timers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;status_publisher:&lt;/b&gt;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/status&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonStatus, callback: on_status_received_callback) - receives the current hybrid automaton status. Can utilizes this to make decisions of if we need to stop hybrid automaton if error status is occuring and so on.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;guard_evaluation_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/guard_evaluation&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonGuardEvaluation) - Publishes guard evaluation results with associated metadata for transition monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;dynamics_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/dynamics&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonDynamics) - Publishes the continuous dynamics computation results for the current active mode.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;invariant_publisher&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Publisher(topic: &quot;/hybrid_automaton/invariant&quot;, type: hybrid_automaton_interfaces/HybridAutomatonInvariant) - Publishes invariant validation results and constraint satisfaction data for the current mode.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-320" y="1040" width="1030" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
